WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.800 --> 00:00:07.560
Quote requests: companies' quote requests; you price each one and send it as a pro-forma.

2
00:00:08.109 --> 00:00:10.850
Open a request and look at the items.

3
00:00:11.395 --> 00:00:16.380
Click "Price it"; the account's tier price is suggested and you can change it.

4
00:00:16.928 --> 00:00:22.720
Send it with "Send pro-forma"; the customer's answer shows under "Customer's decision".

5
00:00:23.270 --> 00:00:30.580
If the chat's 24-hour window is closed, the message waits in a queue; send the request page link another way.
